sembly. There are three chassis currently offered in the game. A hatchback streetcar, and two licensed kit cars. Our philosophy behind Wrench is to allow players to fail, get lost, and do things incorrectly. We use limited 2d UI and prefer world interactions. There is no automated inventory system, players must keep track of all of their parts, and we provide organizational tools to help players manage their spaces. The garage space has customizable workbenches, flooring, and storage.<br><br>Wrench is a traditional desktop keyboard and mouse game with a VR mode for Oculus, Index, WMR, Vive, and Vive Cosmos (experimental).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-op support</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/00388b5ce9c98b0afcd481067e0ff123.poster.avif?t=1750871915\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/00388b5ce9c98b0afcd481067e0ff123.webm?t=1750871915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/00388b5ce9c98b0afcd481067e0ff123.mp4?t=1750871915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Socket Selection</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/dc47200d724d938d94300cb8feeeefbe.poster.avif?t=1750871915\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/dc47200d724d938d94300cb8feeeefbe.webm?t=1750871915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/936720/extras/dc47200d724d938d94300cb8feeeefbe.mp4?t=1750871915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pegboard organization</h2><span cl